H('405.d.7.D',3,"Modifying a product's design to fit a new need, such as adding a handle, is an example of:","improving a design",["wasting parts","copying","destroying"],"Redesign meets needs.")
H('405.d.7.D',4,"Before modifying a working system, an engineer should consider how the change affects:","the other parts of the system",["only the label","only the box","the weather"],"Changes ripple through systems.")
H('405.d.8.A',3,"Two different CADD programs may differ in their cost, their learning curve, and the:","types of drawings they handle best",["color of the icon","length of the name","brand of mouse"],"Software features vary.")
H('405.d.8.A',4,"Choosing software for a team means weighing its features against its:","cost and compatibility with partners' files",["packaging","slogan","version color"],"Compatibility matters in teams.")
H('405.d.8.B',3,"ANSI and ISO are examples of organizations that publish:","industry graphic standards",["recipes","jokes","sports rules"],"Standards organizations set drawing rules.")
H('405.d.8.B',4,"A drawing prepared to ANSI standards will use:","standard line types and symbols",["random symbols","personal icons","music notes"],"Standards unify drawings.")
H('405.d.8.C',3,"To meet a standard, a drafter sets the text height, line weights, and:","sheet size",["music","voice","password"],"Standards specify format.")
H('405.d.8.C',4,"A drawing sheet set to size D measures 22 by 34 inches, so it is:","larger than a size A sheet",["smaller than a size A","the same as a size A","a letter-size page"],"Letter size A is 8.5 x 11; D is much larger.")
H('405.d.8.D',3,"A custom toolbar in CADD software can hold:","frequently used commands",["music files","photos","emails"],"Customization saves clicks.")
H('405.d.8.D',4,"Customizing the interface is most helpful because it can:","speed up repeated tasks",["slow the software","hide commands forever","delete drawings"],"Efficiency improves.")
