H('406.d.2.B',4,"In an experiment on bridge strength, the variable the experimenter changes on purpose is the:","independent variable",["dependent variable","constant","control group"],"Independent variables are manipulated.")
H('406.d.2.C',3,"Before cutting metal on a shop saw, a student should wear:","eye protection and secure long hair",["open sandals","loose scarf","headphones only"],"Dress for the hazard.")
H('406.d.2.C',4,"A student notices a coolant spill near a lathe. The safest action is to:","report it and mark the area until it is cleaned",["step over it","ignore it","clean it with bare hands"],"Spills create slip hazards.")
